{"title":"Der Farbwechsel-Tag","puid":"c-natdeu-3/q8oua8","path":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/level-04","type":"normal","voiceLang":"de","voice":"m3_2025","instruction":{"voice":"f5_2025"},"trainers":[{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishButton":true,"textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/04_1_Fenster-copy.lsg","width":350},"instruction":{"text":"Lies und male aus.","speaker":true},"colors":{"red":"rgba(255,128,171,1)","green":"rgba(174,213,129,1)","blue":"rgba(68,138,255,1)","yellow":"rgba(253,216,53,1)"},"atoms":{"a":"Stell dir vor, du wachst auf und alles ist anders. Genau das ist Haris passiert. Als er aus dem Fenster sieht, traut er seinen Augen nicht: Die Sonne strahlt rosa, die Wolken sind hellgrün, die Baumkronen sind blau und die Straße hat gelbe Punkte.","tasks":[{"class":"sonne","color":"red","total":1},{"class":"wolke","color":"green","total":2},{"class":"baum","color":"blue","total":3},{"class":"strasse","color":"yellow","total":11}]}},{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishButton":true,"finishSound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>duck</voice>","textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/04_3_Weg.lsg","width":350},"instruction":{"text":"Lies und male aus.","speaker":true},"colors":{"red":"rgba(244,67,54,1)","green":"rgba(118,255,3,1)","orange":"rgba(255,193,7,1)","purple":"rgba(234,128,252,1)"},"atoms":[{"a":"Haris macht sich mit seinem Fahrrad auf den Weg ins Kino. Gestern war es noch silber, heute ist es knallrot. Unterwegs trifft er Frau Melnik. Doch etwas ist anders: Ihre Haare sind neuerdings blau und das Fell des Hundes hat sich giftgrün gefärbt!","tasks":[{"class":"fahrrad","color":"red","total":1},{"class":"hund","color":"green","total":1}]},{"a":"Der Zebrastreifen, über den Haris gehen muss, ist nicht mehr schwarz und weiß, sondern lila. Im Park auf der anderen Seite schwimmen die Enten fröhlich in einem orangen Teich herum.","tasks":[{"class":"teich","color":"orange","total":1},{"class":"zebrastreifen","color":"purple","total":4}]}]},{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishButton":true,"finishSound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>crunch-munch</voice>","textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/04_4_Popcorn.lsg","width":350},"instruction":{"text":"Lies und male aus.","speaker":true},"colors":{"yellow":"rgba(255,238,88,1)","purple":"rgba(234,128,252,1)","green":"rgba(102,187,106,1)","blue":"rgba(64,196,255,1)"},"atoms":{"a":"Im Kino angekommen, kauft sich Haris Popcorn und ein Getränk. Das Popcorn ist kunterbunt. Es gibt gelbe, grüne, blaue und lilafarbene Stücke. Die Limonade leuchtet hellblau. Haris lacht und ruft: „Der Farbwechsel-Tag ist mein neuer Lieblingstag!“","tasks":[{"class":"popcorn","color":"yellow","total":1},{"class":"popcorn","color":"purple","total":1},{"class":"popcorn","color":"green","total":1},{"class":"popcorn","color":"blue","total":1},{"class":"popcorn","color":"any","total":16},{"class":"limo","color":"blue","total":1}]}}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Lesen – Genau lesen","path":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/topic","puid":"c-natdeu-3/5dgag3"},"parentBlock":{"title":"Lesen und Ausmalen","path":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/block","puid":"c-natdeu-3/mdf917"},"mediaFiles":{"sounds":[{"fileId":"sound/de/custom/crunch-munch","etag":"b56e-46975"},{"fileId":"sound/de/custom/duck","etag":"f1c2-12626"},{"fileId":"sound/de/f5_2025/Lies und male aus.","etag":"78b7-7671"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3_2025/<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>crunch-munch</voice>","isMultiSound":true},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3_2025/<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>duck</voice>","isMultiSound":true}],"svgs":[{"fileId":"svg/c-svg/2017/03/08-citylife01_store01.svg","etag":"2a